# Lesson 4: Pointing
# A child says a word while experiencing something.
# "Cat!" while pointing at the furry thing.
# "Mama!" while reaching for her.
# Pure pairing. Word to experience. No properties yet.

mama : warm
mama : safe
mama : love
dada : warm
dada : safe
dada : love
cat : soft
cat : small
cat : furry
dog : big
dog : loud
dog : furry
ball : round
ball : fun
cup : water
cup : drink
red : bright
hot : danger
hot : ouch
up : sky
no : stop
hi : hello
